syntax:
Function returning an object by value (where RVO/NRVO may apply):

```c++
MyClass myFunction() {
  MyClass obj; // Local object
  // ... some operations on obj ...
  return obj; // Potential for RVO
}

MyClass myFunction2(){
  MyClass obj; // Local object
  // ... some operations on obj ...
  return std::move(obj); // Potential for RVO, compiler might prefer move semantic
}

MyClass myFunction3() {
  MyClass obj; // Local object
  // ... some operations on obj ...
  return {10, 20}; // Potential for RVO - Aggregate Initialization
}
```
